{'symbol': 'GD', 'date': '2022-02-16 14:30:00', 'title': 'GDIT AWARDED $162M DISA IDENTITY, CREDENTIAL AND ACCESS MANAGEMENT PHASE III PRODUCTION OTA AGREEMENT', 'text': 'FALLS CHURCH, VA., FEB. 16, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0GENERAL DYNAMICS INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY (GDIT), A BUSINESS UNIT OF GENERAL DYNAMICS (NYSE:GD), ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS BEEN AWARDED THE IDENTITY, CREDENTIAL AND ACCESS MANAGEMENT (ICAM) OTHER TRANSACTION AUTHORITY (OTA) PHASE III PRODUCTION AGREEMENT BY THE DEFENSE INFORMATION SYSTEMS AGENCY (DISA).'}